# S.S. Botany Bay: "return each creature card you own exiled with it" reaches a card of Bot1's that BOT2's ability
# exiled. Bot2's Control Magic steals Bot1's Bear Cub (its owner is still Bot1, CR 108.3); Bot1's Gigantosaurus blocks
# it and kills it, so the Bear Cub dies into BOT1's graveyard (CR 400.7, 108.3). Bot2's {T} ability then exiles it, and
# Bot1 declines the may ("You may exile a card from your graveyard": the Memnite stays). Botany Bay stations the
# Gigantosaurus in one activation to reach 8+ (CR 702.184a, 721.2a-b), and its combat damage to Bot2 returns the Bear
# Cub to Bot1's battlefield - and when its attack is blocked the damage went to a creature, not a player, so nothing
# returns (CR 510.2, 607.2a, 608.2d).

